        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the Reunion members have been captured. None of them knew anything about the specific instructions...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en? What are you looking at that has you so absorbed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't this used to be University Road?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Seems so. Its name was changed later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think this is where my home used to be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_5_4_door",
        "x": 20,
        "y": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": 20,
        "yFrom": 0,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": 0,
        "duration": 15,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wasn't your apartment in Tai Bo?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This was the estate that belonged to my biological father's clan. Looks like it's been renovated. So much time has passed that I barely recognize it anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you live here before studying abroad in Victoria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I've heard that both you and Mister Wei were born to Yan aristocrats, it's really quite astonishing to see a mansion this big.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aristocrats? They were, but I'm not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, your mansion here... How should I call it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, the Ch'en Estate will do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Come in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah woah, isn't this your own house? Why'd you slice the door open?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I forgot to bring the key. Besides, Reunion also just opened a hole along the side wall. They might have caused some unexpected damage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "That doesn't mean you should\u2014 Ah, forget it. If you say so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_home"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to take off your shoes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you serious? Ch'en, answer me honestly, do you hate your old man?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He doesn't deserve to be my father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I remember correctly, you joined the L.G.D. right after you graduated from Victoria and returned to Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I was living in the dorms at the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you never returned here after that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no lingering attachments to this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "People who say stuff like that usually have a lot more going on in their mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyways, do you have any ideas about what this high-value target might be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's deep in her own little world again, huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en, I'll be waiting by the door. Call me when you're ready to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
