    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_5_photo",
        "tiled": true,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 18,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Here it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "A photo from such a long time ago... I thought it had been lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, no... could this be what they're searching for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on? Why would they be after this? Have you lost your marbles as well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll certainly help you, but what are you thinking? Why here, why now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... What'd I expect. Of course you won't answer me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_uptown_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, are you finally ready to go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you get any leads? Or did you want to play with the balls of yarn a bit longer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hard to believe you're still in the mood to crack jokes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I think your mood is just a tiny bit better than it was before though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's as you said. Maybe I did have a bit too much on my mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, according to the reports, Reunion is scattered throughout this entire area, and the forces we deployed earlier are driving them out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's good. That makes our job easier, and we're getting closer to our goal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D., get into formation and move out! We're going to take back Lungmen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
